msgid "# Contributing Triton operators"
msgstr "# 贡献 Triton 算子"

msgid "## Deliverables checklist"
msgstr "## 交付物清单"

msgid ""
"- [ ] PR description.\n"
"- [ ] Source files.\n"
"- [ ] Markdown operator document: `vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/<operator>.md`.\n"
"- [ ] Test files: `tests/e2e/nightly/single_node/ops/singlecard_ops/triton/`; warmup unit tests, when applicable: `tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/`.\n"
"- [ ] Repository-wide deliverables: see the [contribution guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/developer_guide/contribution/index.html) and [release note guide](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/release_notes/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] PR 描述。\n"
"- [ ] 源文件。\n"
"- [ ] Markdown 算子文档：`vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/<operator>.md`。\n"
"- [ ] 测试文件：`tests/e2e/nightly/single_node/ops/singlecard_ops/triton/`；如适用，warmup 单元测试：`tests/ut/model_executor/warmup/`。\n"
"- [ ] 仓库级交付物：参见[贡献指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/developer_guide/contribution/index.html)和[发布说明指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/release_notes/README.md)。"

msgid "## Overall objectives"
msgstr "## 总体目标"

msgid ""
"Triton operators merged into the project should meet quality requirements in"
" four areas:"
msgstr "合入项目的 Triton 算子应在以下四个方面满足质量要求："

msgid ""
"1. **Functionality:** Implement the required functionality and preserve compatibility across applicable devices supported by the project.\n"
"2. **Accuracy:** Meet operator-level and model-level accuracy criteria.\n"
"3. **Performance:** Performance optimization PRs improve over the baseline. Other PRs avoid unjustified performance regressions.\n"
"4. **Clean Code:** Keep code readable and maintainable, use reasonable specialization, and avoid undeclared external side effects."
msgstr ""
"1. **功能：** 实现所需功能，并在项目支持的适用设备上保持兼容性。\n"
"2. **精度：** 满足算子级和模型级的精度标准。\n"
"3. **性能：** 性能优化类 PR 相对基线有所提升；其他 PR 应避免出现缺乏依据的性能回退。\n"
"4. **整洁代码：** 保持代码可读、可维护，使用合理的特化，避免未声明的外部副作用。"

msgid "## Detailed requirements"
msgstr "## 详细要求"

msgid ""
"Contributors must provide the following content in the deliverables before "
"merge."
msgstr "贡献者必须在合入前于交付物中提供以下内容。"

msgid "### Functionality"
msgstr "### 功能"

msgid ""
"- [ ] The PR description includes:\n"
"    - [ ] Functionality, inputs and outputs, production callers, and whether the operator is framework-wide or model-specific.\n"
"    - [ ] Motivation, such as model support, a bug fix, performance optimization, or temporary compatibility. Temporary implementations include a replacement and removal plan.\n"
"    - [ ] Cross-device compatibility and actual validation results. Operators should not be restricted to one particular device; device-specific optimization preserves functionality and correctness on other applicable devices.\n"
"- [ ] The Markdown document follows the [operator template](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/triton_description_specification.md), describing functionality, algorithm, parameters, constraints, origin and differences, and test entry points.\n"
"- [ ] The implementation matches the documented inputs, outputs, and behavior.\n"
"- [ ] The operator is integrated into the corresponding model or shared operator call path in vLLM-Ascend."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] PR 描述包含：\n"
"    - [ ] 功能、输入与输出、生产环境调用方，以及该算子是框架通用还是模型专用。\n"
"    - [ ] 动机，例如模型支持、缺陷修复、性能优化或临时兼容。临时实现需包含替换与移除计划。\n"
"    - [ ] 跨设备兼容性和实际验证结果。算子不应被限制在某一特定设备上；针对特定设备的优化应保持其他适用设备上的功能与正确性。\n"
"- [ ] Markdown 文档遵循[算子模板](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/triton_description_specification.md)，描述功能、算法、参数、约束、来源与差异以及测试入口。\n"
"- [ ] 实现与文档中描述的输入、输出和行为一致。\n"
"- [ ] 该算子已集成到 vLLM-Ascend 中对应的模型或共享算子调用路径。"

msgid "### Accuracy"
msgstr "### 精度"

msgid ""
"- [ ] The PR description includes:\n"
"    - [ ] Operator accuracy results against a reference implementation.\n"
"    - [ ] Model accuracy results against the baseline on an evaluation dataset such as GPQA, with evaluation settings.\n"
"- [ ] Test files provide:\n"
"    - [ ] Coverage of all declared input categories and relevant boundaries.\n"
"    - [ ] For framework-wide operators, coverage of the general interface and representative real shapes from applicable models.\n"
"    - [ ] For model-specific operators, coverage of real shapes and parameter combinations reachable in the target models under the declared configurations.\n"
"    - [ ] Parameterized representative cases and boundaries, avoiding redundant cases.\n"
"- [ ] The Markdown document identifies the reference implementation, applicable accuracy criteria, and test commands."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] PR 描述包含：\n"
"    - [ ] 算子相对参考实现的精度结果。\n"
"    - [ ] 模型在 GPQA 等评测数据集上相对基线的精度结果，并说明评测设置。\n"
"- [ ] 测试文件提供：\n"
"    - [ ] 覆盖所有声明的输入类别及相关边界。\n"
"    - [ ] 对于框架通用算子，覆盖通用接口以及适用模型中的代表性真实 shape。\n"
"    - [ ] 对于模型专用算子，覆盖在声明配置下目标模型中可达的真实 shape 与参数组合。\n"
"    - [ ] 参数化的代表性用例与边界，避免冗余用例。\n"
"- [ ] Markdown 文档指明参考实现、适用的精度标准以及测试命令。"

msgid ""
"See [Reference accuracy criteria](#reference-accuracy-criteria) in the "
"appendix. Data movement and integer or index outputs require exact "
"comparison as appropriate to their semantics."
msgstr ""
"参见附录中的[参考精度标准](#reference-accuracy-criteria)。数据搬运以及整数或索引输出需根据其语义进行精确比较。"

msgid "### Performance"
msgstr "### 性能"

msgid ""
"For non-performance PRs, avoid unjustified performance regressions. New "
"functionality may justify a reasonable end-to-end regression; quantify and "
"explain it. Model performance may be reported as percentage changes rather "
"than absolute figures."
msgstr ""
"对于非性能类 "
"PR，应避免缺乏依据的性能回退。新增功能可能带来合理的端到端性能回退，此时需量化并说明。模型性能可以以百分比变化的形式报告，而不必给出绝对值。"

msgid ""
"- [ ] The PR description includes:\n"
"    - [ ] Operator performance results against the baseline.\n"
"    - [ ] Model performance results on a workload such as GSM8K, identifying latency or throughput metrics.\n"
"    - [ ] Matching comparison conditions, including versions, devices, inputs, model configuration, and measurement methodology."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] PR 描述包含：\n"
"    - [ ] 算子相对基线的性能结果。\n"
"    - [ ] 模型在 GSM8K 等工作负载上的性能结果，并标明时延或吞吐指标。\n"
"    - [ ] 一致的对比条件，包括版本、设备、输入、模型配置和测量方法。"

msgid "### Clean Code"
msgstr "### 整洁代码"

msgid ""
"- [ ] Source files meet these requirements:\n"
"    - [ ] Clear responsibility boundaries, reasonable reuse, and comments explaining important design choices. See [coding guidelines](#triton-operator-coding-guidelines).\n"
"    - [ ] Clear naming consistent with surrounding code. Operator documents are named after the operator and follow the [repository layout](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/README.md).\n"
"    - [ ] No silent changes to caller-visible dtype, layout, contents, or external state. Permitted in-place behavior is documented and tested.\n"
"- [ ] The PR description includes a recompilation risk assessment based on [JIT specialization and recompilation](#jit-specialization-and-recompilation):\n"
"    - [ ] **White-box analysis:** Parameter domains, specialization triggers, and justification for annotations such as constexpr and specialization controls.\n"
"    - [ ] **Black-box validation:** Observed shapes and specialization metadata on a workload such as GPQA, with compilation counts separated by startup and serving phases.\n"
"    - [ ] Causes and mitigation of unnecessary variants, plus remaining compilation conditions.\n"
"- [ ] Where warmup is used:\n"
"    - [ ] Source files include the wrapper and registration site for required variants.\n"
"    - [ ] Test files cover key space, registration windows, and runtime coverage.\n"
"    - [ ] The Markdown document describes warmup scope and related configuration."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] 源文件满足以下要求：\n"
"    - [ ] 清晰的职责边界、合理的复用，以及说明重要设计选择的注释。参见[编码规范](#triton-operator-coding-guidelines)。\n"
"    - [ ] 命名清晰，并与周边代码保持一致。算子文档以算子命名，并遵循[仓库目录结构](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/README.md)。\n"
"    - [ ] 不对调用方可见的 dtype、布局、内容或外部状态做静默变更。允许的原地（in-place）行为需有文档说明并经过测试。\n"
"- [ ] PR 描述包含基于 [JIT 特化与重编译](#jit-specialization-and-recompilation) 的重编译风险评估：\n"
"    - [ ] **白盒分析：** 参数取值域、特化触发条件，以及 constexpr 等标注和特化控制项的依据。\n"
"    - [ ] **黑盒验证：** 在 GPQA 等工作负载上观测到的 shape 与特化元数据，并按启动阶段和服务阶段分别统计编译次数。\n"
"    - [ ] 不必要变体的成因与缓解措施，以及仍存在的编译条件。\n"
"- [ ] 在使用 warmup 的场景下：\n"
"    - [ ] 源文件包含所需变体的封装与注册位置。\n"
"    - [ ] 测试文件覆盖键空间、注册窗口和运行时覆盖情况。\n"
"    - [ ] Markdown 文档描述 warmup 范围及相关配置。"

msgid ""
"Reduce unnecessary specialization before warming up required variants. See "
"the upstream [vLLM JIT kernel warmup "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing/jit_kernel_warmup/) for "
"integration. For Ascend registration and validation, see [Triton JIT warmup "
"on Ascend](../Design_Documents/triton_jit_warmup.md)."
msgstr ""
"在预热所需变体之前，减少不必要的特化。集成方式请参阅上游 [vLLM JIT kernel "
"预热指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/contributing/jit_kernel_warmup/)。关于昇腾上的注册与校验，请参阅"
" [昇腾上的 Triton JIT 预热](../Design_Documents/triton_jit_warmup.md)。"

msgid "## Appendix"
msgstr "## 附录"

msgid "### Reference accuracy criteria"
msgstr "### 参考精度标准"

msgid ""
"- **Absolute tolerance (`atol`)**: a fixed error allowance, including when the reference is near zero.\n"
"- **Relative tolerance (`rtol`)**: an error allowance proportional to the absolute reference value."
msgstr ""
"- **绝对容差（`atol`）**：固定的误差允许范围，包括参考值接近零的情况。\n"
"- **相对容差（`rtol`）**：与参考值绝对值成比例的误差允许范围。"

msgid "Compare each output element `actual_i` with its reference `golden_i`:"
msgstr "将每个输出元素 `actual_i` 与其参考值 `golden_i` 进行比较："

msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left|\\mathrm{actual}_i-\\mathrm{golden}_i\\right| \\leq \\mathrm{atol}+\\mathrm{rtol}\\cdot\\left|\\mathrm{golden}_i\\right|\n"
"$$"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left|\\mathrm{actual}_i-\\mathrm{golden}_i\\right| \\leq \\mathrm{atol}+\\mathrm{rtol}\\cdot\\left|\\mathrm{golden}_i\\right|\n"
"$$"

msgid "| Output dtype | rtol | atol | Maximum absolute error |"
msgstr "| 输出数据类型 | rtol | atol | 最大绝对误差 |"

msgid "Both conditions must hold:"
msgstr "以下两个条件必须同时满足："

msgid ""
"1. At least 99% of elements satisfy the combined tolerance.\n"
"2. The maximum absolute error across all elements does not exceed the corresponding limit."
msgstr ""
"1. 至少 99% 的元素满足组合容差。\n"
"2. 所有元素中的最大绝对误差不超过相应限值。"

msgid ""
"The maximum-error rule is "
"$\\max\\left(\\mathrm{fixed\\_limit},\\;32\\cdot\\mathrm{ULP}_{1.0}\\right)$,"
" where $\\mathrm{ULP}_{1.0}$ is the unit in the last place at 1.0 for the "
"output dtype; use the explicit limits in the table."
msgstr ""
"最大误差规则为 "
"$\\max\\left(\\mathrm{fixed\\_limit},\\;32\\cdot\\mathrm{ULP}_{1.0}\\right)$，其中"
" $\\mathrm{ULP}_{1.0}$ 是输出数据类型在 1.0 处的最后一位单位（ULP）；请使用表中给出的明确限值。"

msgid "### Triton operator coding guidelines"
msgstr "### Triton 算子编码规范"

msgid "#### Naming"
msgstr "#### 命名"

msgid ""
"- Use `snake_case` for functions, ordinary parameters, and local variables, for example `hidden_size` and `num_tokens`.\n"
"- Use `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` for constants and compile-time parameters, for example `BLOCK_SIZE`. Use `tl.constexpr` only when compile-time evaluation is needed.\n"
"- For Tensor arguments of a Triton kernel, prefer `xxx_ptr` names, for example `input_ptr` and `output_ptr`.\n"
"- Replace unexplained magic numbers with named constants or derived expressions. Explain the purpose and selection rationale of algorithm and tuning constants."
msgstr ""
"- 函数、普通参数和局部变量使用 `snake_case`，例如 `hidden_size` 和 `num_tokens`。\n"
"- 常量和编译期参数使用 `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`，例如 `BLOCK_SIZE`。仅在需要编译期求值时使用 `tl.constexpr`。\n"
"- 对于 Triton kernel 的 Tensor 参数，优先使用 `xxx_ptr` 命名，例如 `input_ptr` 和 `output_ptr`。\n"
"- 将未说明的魔法数字替换为具名常量或推导表达式。说明算法常量和调优常量的用途及选取依据。"

msgid "#### Public interface and integration"
msgstr "#### 公共接口与集成"

msgid ""
"- Expose a Python wrapper; callers use it instead of launching the kernel directly.\n"
"- Encapsulate input handling, output allocation, grid calculation and tiling in the wrapper.\n"
"- Document supported shapes, dtypes, layouts and in-place behavior. Reject unsupported inputs or use an existing fallback.\n"
"- Use consistent launch-configuration rules for warmup and runtime execution."
msgstr ""
"- 暴露一个 Python 封装层；调用方使用该封装层，而不是直接启动 kernel。\n"
"- 在封装层中封装输入处理、输出分配、grid 计算和 tiling。\n"
"- 记录支持的形状、数据类型、布局和原地操作行为。拒绝不支持的输入，或使用已有的回退方案。\n"
"- 预热和运行时执行使用一致的启动配置规则。"

msgid "#### Interface structure example"
msgstr "#### 接口结构示例"

msgid ""
"The following pseudocode shows the interface boundaries; it is not a "
"runnable operator implementation."
msgstr "以下伪代码展示了接口边界；它并非可运行的算子实现。"

msgid "Callers import and use the public entry point:"
msgstr "调用方导入并使用公共入口点："

msgid "### JIT specialization and recompilation"
msgstr "### JIT 特化与重新编译"

msgid ""
"A new specialization requires compilation when no reusable artifact is "
"cached. The table covers ordinary Tensor and scalar arguments; exact "
"specialization rules depend on the Triton version and backend."
msgstr "当没有可复用的缓存产物时，新的特化需要编译。下表涵盖普通 Tensor 和标量参数；具体的特化规则取决于 Triton 版本和后端。"

msgid "| Input or configuration | Specialization trigger |"
msgstr "| 输入或配置 | 特化触发条件 |"

msgid "| `tl.constexpr` | Compile-time value changes. |"
msgstr "| `tl.constexpr` | 编译期值发生变化。 |"

msgid "| Tensor dtype | Pointer element type changes. |"
msgstr "| Tensor 数据类型 | 指针元素类型发生变化。 |"

msgid ""
"| Tensor address | Alignment class changes; the full address is not the key."
" |"
msgstr "| Tensor 地址 | 对齐类别发生变化；完整地址并非关键。 |"

msgid ""
"| Tensor shape / stride | Changes affect separately passed scalars, "
"constexpr values, alignment or compiler options. |"
msgstr "| Tensor 形状 / 步长 | 变化会影响单独传递的标量、constexpr 值、对齐或编译器选项。 |"

msgid ""
"| Runtime integer | Inferred type or default specialization class changes, "
"such as exact `1`, multiples of `16`, or other values. |"
msgstr "| 运行时整数 | 推断类型或默认特化类别发生变化，例如精确的 `1`、`16` 的倍数或其他值。 |"

msgid ""
"| Runtime float / bool | Type changes; values alone do not specialize unless"
" passed as constexpr. |"
msgstr "| 运行时浮点数 / 布尔值 | 类型发生变化；除非作为 constexpr 传递，否则仅值本身不会触发特化。 |"

msgid ""
"| Optional argument | Switching between `None` and a Tensor changes the "
"signature. |"
msgstr "| 可选参数 | 在 `None` 和 Tensor 之间切换会改变签名。 |"

msgid "| Compiler options | Effective compilation settings change. |"
msgstr "| 编译器选项 | 生效的编译设置发生变化。 |"

msgid ""
"Changing only Tensor contents or the launch grid does not create a new "
"specialization. Source, compiler, target and cache-state changes can also "
"affect artifact reuse."
msgstr "仅更改 Tensor 内容或启动 grid 不会产生新的特化。源码、编译器、目标以及缓存状态的变化也可能影响产物复用。"

msgid "Specialization controls:"
msgstr "特化控制项："

msgid ""
"- `do_not_specialize`: suppress value/alignment specialization for selected runtime arguments; type differences and explicit constexpr values still matter.\n"
"- `do_not_specialize_on_alignment`: suppress alignment/divisibility specialization; other specialization remains.\n"
"- Validate accuracy and performance after reducing specialization, then use warmup for required variants."
msgstr ""
"- `do_not_specialize`：对选定的运行时参数抑制值/对齐特化；类型差异和显式 constexpr 值仍然有效。\n"
"- `do_not_specialize_on_alignment`：抑制对齐/整除特化；其他特化仍然保留。\n"
"- 减少特化后，请验证精度和性能，然后对所需变体进行预热。"

msgid ""
"An `autotune` key selects tuning cases. Retuning and loading a persistent "
"cache are distinct from recompiling a kernel."
msgstr "`autotune` 键用于选择调优用例。重新调优和加载持久化缓存与重新编译 kernel 是不同的。"

msgid ""
"References: [Triton JIT API](https://triton-lang.org/main/python-"
"api/generated/triton.jit.html), [autotune API](https://triton-"
"lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.autotune.html), [triton-ascend JIT"
" implementation](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/runtime/jit.py), [backend "
"specialization](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/backends/compiler.py), [compilation "
"cache](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/compiler/compiler.py)."
msgstr ""
"参考资料：[Triton JIT API](https://triton-lang.org/main/python-"
"api/generated/triton.jit.html)、[autotune API](https://triton-"
"lang.org/main/python-api/generated/triton.autotune.html)、[triton-ascend JIT "
"实现](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/runtime/jit.py)、[后端特化](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/backends/compiler.py)、[编译缓存](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend/blob/main/python/triton/compiler/compiler.py)。"
